# uniqueness

Hand-written text.

<!-- use-case-instances:start -->
Each instance is a contract in `<scheme>/src/main.nr`, entrypoint `act_once(terms, evidence)` (anon_aadhaar: `act_once(terms, evidence, choice)`), package `<scheme>_uniqueness`, tested by `scripts/test-use-cases.sh uniqueness/<scheme>` (no TXE tests for anon_aadhaar). Its `src/test.nr` has the tests `valid`, `replay_rejected`, `wrong_issuer_rejected`, `wrong_person_kind_rejected`, `wrong_binding_rejected`, `stale_rejected`, `second_use_rejected`; [use-cases.json](../use-cases.json) records each exception and its reason. The category is the evidence category of [ARCHITECTURE.md](../ARCHITECTURE.md#evidence-and-authority).

